cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Makam Descriptor: a culture-aware, abstaining description tool for Turkish makam music scores"
abstract: >-
  A description tool for Turkish makam music, designed to be called by an LLM
  agent. It describes a SymbTr score in the tradition's own terms at 53-comma
  resolution and abstains when a piece falls outside what its theory layer
  knows. Theory layer: 7 makams, Arel-Ezgi-Uzdilek system, unreviewed.
  Evaluated on SymbTr 2.4.3 with a composer-level dev/test split.
authors:
  - alias: "d3st1n4"
version: "0.3.0"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/3cthulhu3/makam-descriptor"
keywords:
  - Turkish makam music
  - music information retrieval
  - computational musicology
  - makam recognition
  - abstention
  - 53-TET
  - SymbTr
references:
